  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Today is Mother's Day. In the morning, the daughter and son said to their mother: \"Mom, happy Mother's Day. We love you!\" Mom smiled. The daughter bought a dress for her mother, and her son bought flowers for her mother. These are all things that her mother likes, and her mother is very happy."
  ],
  "english_full": "Today is Mother's Day. In the morning, the daughter and son said to their mother: \"Mom, happy Mother's Day. We love you!\" Mom smiled. The daughter bought a dress for her mother, and her son bought flowers for her mother. These are all things that her mother likes, and her mother is very happy.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Сего́дня — День ма́тери. У́тром до́чка и сын ска́зали своей ма́тери: «Ма́ма, сча́стливого Дня ма́тери. Мы лю́бим тебя!» Ма́ма улы́бнулась. До́чка ку́пила пла́тье для своей ма́тери, а сын ку́пил цветы́ для своей ма́тери. Э́ти всё вéщи, кои́ нравятся её ма́тери, и её ма́тери о́чень сча́стливо."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Segódnya — Dén' máteri. Útrom dóchka i sýn skázali svoéi máteri: «Máma, schástlivogo Dén' máteri. My lyúbim tebjá!» Máma ulýbnulas'. Dóchka kúpila plát'e dlya svoéi máteri, a sýn kúpil tsvéty dlya svoéi máteri. Éti vsé véshi, koí nravyatsya yeó máteri, i yeó máteri óchen' schástlivo."
  ],
